      "message": "test: check combining conflicting taproot leaf scripts\n\nTwo PSBTs that map the same control block to different leaf scripts used to\ncombine into a PSBT that could not be decoded again. The cases that do not\nconflict are covered too, to make sure merging still keeps every record.",
